// DEFECT: React hooks (useState/useCallback) have no SLA counterpart; state modelled as a plain struct + functions.
// DEFECT: async functions converted to synchronous functions returning a status code.
// DEFECT: dynamic objects (AuthUser / AuthSession / Record<string, unknown>) approximated as JSON text buffers.
